sequenceDiagram
    participant JVM as 崩溃线程
    participant CA as CrashAdapter Handler
    participant CU as CrashUtils
    participant Disk as 本地文件

    Note over CA: init 时包装 defaultHandler
    JVM->>CA: uncaughtException
    CA->>CA: AndroidLogFormat.format(throwable)
    CA->>Disk: crash_时间戳.txt 同步写
    CA->>Disk: 追加到当小时 log_yyyyMMddHH.txt
    CA->>CU: previous.uncaughtException
    CU->>Disk: CrashUtils 自己的 crash 目录
